#
# File:         sdkconfig.defaults.ws2
# Module:       Build / ESP-IDF defaults, Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-2 layer
#
# Purpose:      What the Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-2 build changes from
#               sdkconfig.defaults and the S3 layer. platformio.ini names it
#               for the board's environments through SDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS
#               (board_build.cmake_extra_args); IDF 5.3.1's project.cmake
#               takes that list in place of the default one and still adds
#               each file's .esp32s3 twin, so the order read is
#               sdkconfig.defaults, sdkconfig.defaults.esp32s3, this.
#
#               The chip is the LCD-1.47's (ESP32-S3R8: 8 MB octal PSRAM),
#               so the S3 layer's PSRAM, console and Wi-Fi buffers stand as
#               they are. This layer adds only the camera's sensors.
#
#               PlatformIO only watches sdkconfig.defaults for changes:
#               delete sdkconfig.ws_s3touch2* after editing here, and check
#               the generated file. A value outside its Kconfig range is
#               discarded, not clamped.
#
# Targets:      Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-2 (ESP-IDF 5.3.1)
# See also:     sdkconfig.defaults, sdkconfig.defaults.esp32s3,
#               platformio.ini, src/board.h
